OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission issues are 'far
OL,4,Afrom resolved', DUP leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the DUP has said the
OL,7,Fissues surrounding the Parades
OL,8,FCommission are "far from resolved",
OL,9,Fafter one of the commissioners resigned
OL,10,Fover the handling of its ruling on the
OL,11,FOrange Order's Drumcree parade.
OL,13,FThe commission has until the end of the
OL,14,Fday to write to Secretary of State Sir
OL,15,FChris Bryant, to ensure him that their
OL,16,Fdecision making processes are fair.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
