OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission issues are 'far
OL,4,Afrom resolved', DUP leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe commission has been asked to come
OL,7,Fup with a credible plan to enhance
OL,8,Fpublic confidence across all
OL,9,Fcommunities after a court case
OL,10,Fhighlighted mistakes over the
OL,11,Fcommission's ruling on the annual
OL,12,FDrumcree parade.
OL,14,FGavin Robinson has said Sir Chris has a
OL,15,Fresponsibility to look at whether he
OL,16,Fhas confidence in the parade
OL,17,Fcommissioners.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
